      ],
      "text": "PICO question",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        508.0502014160156,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "The recommendation in this section results from assessments of the PICO question listed below.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.47807312011719,
        110.25061798095703,
        515.7993774414062,
        125.91461944580078
      ],
      "text": "(DR-TB, 2022): Should HCV treatment be co-administered with MDR-TB treatment  PICO question",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.947826385498047,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        123.45063018798828,
        303.9759826660156,
        139.11463928222656
      ],
      "text": "in patients co-infected by MDR/RR-TB and HCV?",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.57044982910156,
        224.82371520996094,
        171.23043823242188
      ],
      "text": "Data and studies considered",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        178.4384307861328,
        527.2321166992188,
        192.8814239501953
      ],
      "text": "In 2022, a systematic review identified a total of 106 studies reporting on the prevalence of HCV among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.948379516601562,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        191.63844299316406,
        527.5366821289062,
        206.08143615722656
      ],
      "text": "TB patients. The review reported that the global pooled prevalence of HCVAb positivity across studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983137130737305,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        204.83839416503906,
        527.1083984375,
        219.28138732910156
      ],
      "text": "was 10.4% (95% CI: 8.5–12.5). Pooled prevalence of HCVAb positivity by WHO region was highest in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        218.0384063720703,
        527.2173461914062,
        232.4813995361328
      ],
      "text": "European Region at 17.5% (95% CI: 12.2–23.5), followed by South-East Asia at 7.9% (95% CI: 3.5–13.9),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95455551147461,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        231.23854064941406,
        527.4253540039062,
        245.68153381347656
      ],
      "text": "the Americas at 7.5% (95% CI: 5.2–10.1), the Western Pacific at 6.2% (95% CI: 3.6–9.5), the Eastern",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        243.16249084472656,
        470.9418029785156,
        258.8815002441406
      ],
      "text": "(142, 143) Mediterranean at 5.7% (95% CI: 3.1–8.9) and Africa at 3.5% (95% CI: 0–16.1)  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        266.14239501953125,
        527.3804321289062,
        280.5854187011719
      ],
      "text": "As a follow-up to this review, an online survey was designed to gather expert evidence on treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.3424072265625,
        351.1791687011719,
        293.7854309082031
      ],
      "text": "strategies for patients co-infected with HCV and MDR/RR-TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        301.04632568359375,
        527.4530639648438,
        315.4893493652344
      ],
      "text": "The above-mentioned PICO question was originally put forward, and a systematic review was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        314.24627685546875,
        527.420166015625,
        328.6893005371094
      ],
      "text": "conducted to gather relevant data from published research studies. This systematic review identified",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        327.4463195800781,
        527.638916015625,
        341.88934326171875
      ],
      "text": "only one small study fulfilling the eligibility criteria. Two additional small studies described concomitant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970108985900879,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        340.64630126953125,
        527.3967895507812,
        355.0893249511719
      ],
      "text": "treatment and suggested that co-administration of treatment may be well tolerated and associated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.8463134765625,
        527.5543823242188,
        368.2893371582031
      ],
      "text": "with SVR for HCV infection. None of the studies compared the outcomes of patients receiving",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.0462951660156,
        527.4232788085938,
        381.48931884765625
      ],
      "text": "co-administered treatment with those of patients receiving MDR/RR-TB treatment alone. Given the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        380.2463073730469,
        524.42578125,
        394.6893310546875
      ],
      "text": "current state of evidence, no conclusion could be drawn with regards to co-administration of MDR/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        393.4463195800781,
        484.8379211425781,
        407.88934326171875
      ],
      "text": "RR-TB and HCV treatment and MDR/RR-TB outcomes based on available research studies.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        415.1502990722656,
        527.44873046875,
        429.59332275390625
      ],
      "text": "Collection of expert evidence was identified as a solution for addressing a guideline question where",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        428.3503112792969,
        527.5396118164062,
        442.7933349609375
      ],
      "text": "published research evidence is lacking for completion of a GRADE EtD framework. It follows previously",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97081184387207,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.2742919921875,
        527.408447265625,
        455.9933166503906
      ],
      "text": "(142, 143) developed concepts and established steps used with GDGs  . After identifying an external",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        454.75030517578125,
        527.4063110351562,
        469.1933288574219
      ],
      "text": "group of experts to survey for the collection of data about co-administration of treatment for patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980332374572754,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.9503173828125,
        527.4871826171875,
        482.3933410644531
      ],
      "text": "with MDR-TB and HCV co-infection, WHO contacted its regional offices to identify experts with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        481.1502990722656,
        527.4332275390625,
        495.59332275390625
      ],
      "text": "relevant experience in this area. In addition to providing patient outcome data to inform the PICO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        494.3503112792969,
        527.5726928710938,
        508.7933349609375
      ],
      "text": "question, experts were asked for input on other criteria for decision-making including costs, feasibility,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977375984191895,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.55029296875,
        527.4431762695312,
        521.9932861328125
      ],
      "text": "and acceptability of co-administration of MDR-TB and HCV treatments. The expert evidence was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        520.7503051757812,
        527.5595703125,
        535.1932983398438
      ],
      "text": "collected using an online survey, and a quality check of data submitted was completed (e.g. checking",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992547035217285,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        533.9503173828125,
        527.3500366210938,
        548.393310546875
      ],
      "text": "that the sum of health outcomes added up correctly across patients), with contact and email follow-up",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.967401504516602,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        547.1502685546875,
        344.3239440917969,
        561.59326171875
      ],
      "text": "of individual respondents if any clarifications were required.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.9940795898438,
        316.7821350097656,
        593.6541137695312
      ],
      "text": "Methods used for analysis and data synthesis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        600.8621215820312,
        527.2779541015625,
        615.3051147460938
      ],
      "text": "Data collected from respondents who treated at least one patient with MDR/RR-TB and HCV treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.954707145690918,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        614.0621337890625,
        527.44189453125,
        628.505126953125
      ],
      "text": "co-administration (i.e. the intervention arm) and at least one patient with MDR/RR-TB treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        627.2620849609375,
        527.4012451171875,
        641.705078125
      ],
      "text": "with delay of HCV treatment (i.e. the comparator arm) were included in a comparative analysis. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        640.4620971679688,
        527.4199829101562,
        654.9050903320312
      ],
      "text": "analysis calculated the risk ratio (RR) to assess treatment effects for the outcomes of interest (i.e. TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        653.662109375,
        525.8172607421875,
        668.1051025390625
      ],
      "text": "treatment success, TB treatment failure, death, LTFU, AEs, hepatic AEs and HCV treatment success).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.3660278320312,
        524.2620849609375,
        689.8090209960938
      ],
      "text": "Forest plots were constructed to calculate pooled effect estimates, with 95% CIs, using random-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        688.5660400390625,
        527.411376953125,
        703.009033203125
      ],
      "text": "effects meta-analysis. RRs were pooled using the Mantel-Haenszel method, which is robust in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        700.489990234375,
        524.2296142578125,
        716.208984375
      ],
      "text": "(144) case of sparse data  . The estimate of heterogeneity was calculated using the restricted maximum-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.968554496765137,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        713.6900024414062,
        527.3900146484375,
        729.4089965820312
      ],
      "text": "(145) likelihood method   and the standard error of the pooled effect estimate was derived from the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        726.8900146484375,
        527.4174194335938,
        742.6090087890625
      ],
      "text": "(146) Hartung-Knapp-Sidik-Jonkman method  . Extensive simulations have shown that these methods",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        741.3660278320312,
        527.6080322265625,
        755.8090209960938
      ],
      "text": "are less biased than the alternatives, and more robust to changes in the heterogeneity variance",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        753.2900390625,
        527.4130859375,
        769.009033203125
      ],
      "text": "(147) estimate  . In instances of zero events in one arm, an adaptive continuity correction inversely",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330.23760986328125,
        801.0170288085938,
